Package: devontools
Title: Helper and Theme Function with Helpful Vignette
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Devon", "Berkove", , "djb050@bucknell.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package is the culmination of the MATH 306 package project. It contains two functions, one of which is a custom theme function influenced by the Premier League theme, and the other a normalizing function for single attributes in a data frame with the options to create a new proportion column as well. There is also a helpful vignette demonstrating the uses and limits of the functions.
